 "intro": {
  "@es": "Ahora aprenderás a decir que algo es solo eso, sin nada más. Son palabras muy útiles para hablar de lo que comes o de lo que haces.",
  "@en": "Now you'll learn to say that something is just that, with nothing else. They're very useful words to talk about what you eat or what you do."
